.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.nuxt
.output
# Rooted patterns above miss the modtools layer's copies; a host-side build
# leaking modtools/.output into the image makes the prod container skip its
# env-aware first-start build and serve production API URLs in local tests.
**/node_modules
**/.nuxt
**/.output
dist
.env
.env.*
logs
*.log
coverage
monocart-report
playwright-report
test-results